Project Outcome
The Dirt Bike Maintenance Sensor System was successfully built and tested on a 2018 Yamaha YZ450F. Both sensors are working, the Bluetooth connection is live, and the web dashboard displays real-time data on an iPhone through Bluefy. AI was used throughout the entire build process — from debugging firmware to designing the dashboard — and played a direct role in both speeding things up and occasionally sending the project in the wrong direction.

